# Auto-generated documentation
/static/feeds/*.json
/static/data/*.json
!/static/data/sbom-attestations.json
!/static/data/sbom-attestations-frontend.json
!/static/data/firehose-apps.json
!/static/data/artwork.json
!/static/data/artwork-versions.json
!/static/data/gnome-extensions.json
!/static/data/hive-history.json
!/static/data/countme-history.json
!/static/data/scorecard-history.json
!/static/data/update-churn.json
!/static/data/update-churn-createdat.json
// committed next to the churn cache: fetchGhcrTagCreatedAt writes the per-tag
// build-time sidecar here, and the update-churn-cache workflow `git add`s it
// explicitly. Without the allow-list the parent `/static/data/*.json` ignore
// (line 19) discards it, so the sidecar is never committed and the same-day
// tie-break is lost after a checkout (see #1472).
# github-profiles.json is intentionally gitignored — it is populated at build
# time by scripts/fetch-github-profiles.js and cached via GHA cache key
# github-profiles-v1-* (see .github/workflows/update-github-profiles-cache.yml).

